  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "42",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 42"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "42",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakoba watiyili nawu muEjipitu mudi tidiku. Yakoba wayililianyanindi, nindi, Mudi nakuditaladi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Ami natiyi nawumuEjipitu mudi tidiku. Yenuku mwakatulandili, twakahandi, twakabulikufwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana kwaYosefu ikumi dawu ayili kuEjipitu akalandi tidiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa Benjamini, mana kwaYosefu, Yakoba hamutemesheli hamu nawana kwinduku, nindi, Chuma chatama chakamba kamuwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyana kaIsraela ayili nakulanda hamu nawakwawu ayiluku, muloŋa nzala yadiŋi mwituŋa daKenani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu diyi wadiŋi mulopu wetuŋa; yena diyi wadiŋi nakulanaisha antu ejima amwituya. Ana kwaYosefu ashikili, amubandaminini mahamawu hamaseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu wamweni ana kwindi, wayilukili, wadimwekesheli kudi wena neyi himuntu wacheŋi, wahosheli nawu chakola hohu, wayilili nindi, Enu munafumi kudihi? Nawu, Tunafumi mwituŋa daKenani, tunenzi nakulanda kudya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu diyi wayilukili ana kwindi ilaŋa wena hiyamwilukili yenaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu wa anukili mwayiloteleliyi, hakuyilanindi, Enu muyakwakwendesha ituŋa; munenzi nakutala ituŋa chididi damukunkulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena hiyakumwila nawu, Nehi mwanta, etu ambuŋeyi tunenzi nakulanda kudya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wejima wetu tuyanyana kamuntu wumu, tuyantu alala, etu ambuŋeyi hitunenzi nakwendesha itupaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyilanindi, Nehi, chimunenjili munalondi kutala ituŋa chididi damukunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena nawu, Etu ambuŋeyi twekala amayala ikumi nayedi, ivumudetu dimu, tuyanyana kamuntu wumu hohu wamwituŋa daKenani; kabindaketu wudi kwatata yetu, mukwawu wachachaŋana dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu hakuyila nindi, Dichi chinayilili nami, Enu muyakwakwendesha ituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu mutwakayesekela, kunyima yaFwaro kwaamu, kunu himukufumakwoku, chiŋa kabinda kenu yenza kunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Temeshenu mwinenu wumuakamuleti mwanyikenu, enu nawa mukushala munyonji, kulonda kwesekanachu mazu enu tutali neyi munahoshi mwalala. Mukunkulwayi dinu, kunyima yaFwaro kwaamu, yenu akwakwendesha hohu mwalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayishili wejima wawu mwakasilaŋawu antu, mafuku asatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku damu chisatu Yosefu wayilili nindi, Tiyenu mumukwila muhandi; muloŋa ami namutiyaŋa Nzambi woma; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neyi enu muyantu alala, tukasi mwinenu wumu mukaleya mumudi, enu muyi kwenu mutwali tidiku yakudiisha antaŋa jenu adi nanzala, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwakaleti kunidami kabinda kenu, kulonda twakeluki netu munahoshi mwalala, kulonda mwakabuli kufwa. Dimu mweliluwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakudiihula niniwu niniwu, nawu, Chalalatuna bayi hansaŋu yamana kwetu, chitwamweni chatiyiliyi kutama mumuchimawindi, chatulembeleliyi, etu kwonti kwetu kutiya, dihu hanafumi kumona lukadi ilu lutukumona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rubeni hakuyila nindi, Ami hinayihoshelinami, Bayi mumwila kansi chatamaku? Enu kwenu kwonti kwenukutiya. Talenu ntahi dinu, hitukukoola mashi indi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena kwilukanawu Yosefu nachitiyi nehi; muloŋa hadiŋi mukwakuyibalumwina mazuhakachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Washetumukili nakuyifutalela, hakudila nikudila; wabalumukili cheŋi kudi wena, hakuhosha nawu; hakwambulamu Simeyona, hakumukasa kumesu awu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu walejeh antu, nindi enzeshi tidikumuyuma yawu yakusendela, nindi ayifuntishili wejima wawu hamuntuha muntu mali awu, iwu munjeki yindi, iwu munjeki yindi, ayinki niyakudya yakudiila munjila. Dichi cheliluwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atwikili ayimbulu yawu yisenda yawu yatidiku yawu, hiyakuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaminuwu, wumu hakukasununa munjeki yindi, nindi amwinkichimbulu chindi yakudya, hakumona mali indi mukanwa kanjeki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyila ana kwindi, nindi, Mali ami ananfuntishili; awa adi munjeki yami awa; ninyichima yawu mwivumu puchi, hiyakuditala nakuzaala hohu, nawu, Ichichuma chanatwiluwu kudi Nzambi hichumanyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashikili kudi tata yawu Yakoba mwituŋa daKenani, amulejeli mwamwenuwu mwejima to-o, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawu, Yenowu muntu neli mulopu wetuŋa, watuhosha chakola hohu, watwila nindi tuyakwakwendesha ituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etutwamwila netu, Etu tuyantu alala, hituyakwakwendeshaku; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
