          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tata yawu Yakoba hakuyila nindi, Ami munankonki anyanami. Yosefu kwosi, Simeyona kwosi, mutwalinawa niBenjamini! Yumiyi yejima yinankalili hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
