              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rubeni hakuhosha natata yindi, nindi, Neyi nakabula kukuletelayi cheŋi, wakajaha anyanami wonsu ayedi; munyinki tuhu ami, nakakuletelayi cheŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
