        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Mwanami himukuya ninduku, mana kwindi wafwa dehi, washalakanka windi damunu; neyi chuma chatama chakamuwana munjila yimukuya, mwakashikiji nsuki jami janvu kukaluŋa nayihuŋu.",
